                     skos:definition "Repayment outcome label: 1 means the client had payment difficulties (a late payment of more than a defined number of days on at least one of the first installments in the sample); 0 means all other cases."@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/najma/ontologies/homecredit/hasAgeAtIdPublish
:hasAgeAtIdPublish rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Applicant ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    :valueRange "Must be >= 0: the identity document cannot be changed before the applicant was born."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Calculated as (hasDaysIDPublish - hasAgeInDays) / 365.25."@en ;
    skos:definition "Applicant's age in years when the identity document was last changed."@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/najma/ontologies/homecredit/hasAgeAtRegistration
:hasAgeAtRegistration rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Applicant ;
    rdfs:range xsd:decimal ;
    :valueRange "Must be >= 0: the registration cannot be changed before the applicant was born."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Calculated as (hasRegistrationDaysBeforeApplication - hasAgeInDays) / 365.25."@en ;
    skos:definition "Applicant's age in years when the registration was last changed."@en .


