                                          "Randlow, 'Kaggle: Credit risk (Exploratory Data Analysis)', describe() of DAYS_EMPLOYED: min -17912, max 365243. https://randlow.github.io/posts/machine-learning/kaggle-home-loan-credit-risk-eda"@en ;
                             :valueRange "Observed range: -17912 to 0. Allowed values: or the placeholder 365243 (maximum observed value). Note: Real-data maximum is 365243, a placeholder, not a duration."@en ;
                             skos:definition "How many days before the application the applicant started their current employment, stored as a negative number. The positive value 365243 occurs in application_train.csv as an anomalous placeholder that the official dictionary does not explain."@en .


